---
import Layout from '../../layouts/AlternativeLayout.astro';
import { getAlternativeContent } from '../../lib/alternatives';
const { projects } = await getAlternativeContent();
---
<Layout title="The Machine" theme="the-machine" description="An experimental control surface for unpacking project decisions.">
<div class="machine"><section class="machine-intro"><span class="eyebrow">08 / an explanatory instrument</span><h1>Pull the<br/><i>work</i> apart.</h1><p>Choose a project, then inspect the three-part story: the problem, the decision, and the result. Illustrative labels; real project links.</p><a href="#controls">Operate the machine ↓</a></section><section id="controls" class="controls" aria-labelledby="control-title"><div class="rail"><span class="eyebrow">Project selector</span>{projects.map((p,i)=><button class="project-button" data-i={i} aria-pressed={i===0}>{p.title}<span>0{i+1}</span></button>)}</div><div class="console"><span class="eyebrow" id="control-title">Deconstruction console</span>{projects.map((p,i)=><article class="console-view" hidden={i!==0}><h2>{p.title}</h2><div class="parts"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / problem</span><p>{p.description}</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / decision</span><p>Build a focused tool around the constraints of {p.stack.join(', ')}.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / result</span><p>Explore the working artifact and its source on the project page.</p><a href={p.href}>Visit source ↗</a></div></div></article>)}</div></section></div>
</Layout>
<style>
.machine{background:#d9ff45;color:#171b16}.machine-intro,.controls{min-height:calc(100vh - 82px);padding:clamp(28px,7vw,100px) clamp(20px,7vw,110px)}.machine-intro{background:#171b16;color:#d9ff45;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.machine h1{font-size:clamp(72px,14vw,210px);line-height:.8;letter-spacing:-.09em}.machine i{font-family:'Fraunces Variable',serif;font-weight:400}.machine-intro p{font-size:17px;max-width:38ch;margin:38px 0 28px;color:#f5f3ec}.machine-intro a,.parts a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;min-height:48px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;width:max-content;font-weight:600}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,.6fr) 1.7fr;gap:clamp(25px,6vw,90px);background:#d9ff45}.rail{border-right:1px solid #171b1666;padding-right:25px}.project-button{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;width:100%;min-height:58px;padding:12px 0;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #171b1666;background:none;text-align:left;font-size:clamp(15px,2vw,22px);cursor:pointer}.project-button span{font:11px 'JetBrains Mono Variable',monospace}.project-button[aria-pressed=true]{font-weight:700;padding-left:15px;border-left:5px solid}.console{min-width:0}.console h2{font-size:clamp(55px,10vw,145px);line-height:.8;margin:28px 0 65px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.parts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0}.parts>div{padding:22px;border-left:1px solid #171b1666;min-height:230px}.parts p{margin:18px 0;max-width:27ch;color:#39412f}.parts .eyebrow{font-size:10px}@media(max-width:750px){.controls{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto}.rail{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #171b1666;padding:0 0 20px}.parts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.parts>div{min-height:0;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #171b1666;padding-inline:0}.console h2{margin-bottom:35px}}
</style>
<script>
const buttons=document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.project-button');const views=document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.console-view');buttons.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const i=Number(b.dataset.i);buttons.forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));views.forEach((v,j)=>v.hidden=i!==j)}));
</script>
